{"page":434,"width":1631,"height":2326,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"또한 징릴은 자료 탐색에 있어서 필수적이다. 예를 들면 사전에서 우리가 단어를 쉽게 찾을 수","words":[{"text":"또한","x":172,"y":183,"width":57,"height":30},{"text":"징릴은","x":240,"y":183,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"자료","x":331,"y":183,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"탐색에","x":396,"y":184,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"있어서","x":486,"y":184,"width":72,"height":31},{"text":"필수적이다.","x":572,"y":184,"width":129,"height":32},{"text":"예를","x":714,"y":184,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"들면","x":771,"y":183,"width":47,"height":31},{"text":"사전에서","x":829,"y":182,"width":97,"height":31},{"text":"우리가","x":938,"y":181,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"단어를","x":1026,"y":179,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"쉽게","x":1115,"y":178,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"찾을","x":1177,"y":179,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":1240,"y":179,"width":26,"height":30}]},{"text":"있는 것은 사전안의 단어들이 알파t,겟순으로 정릴되이 있기 때문이다. 만약 사전이 알파,央주으로","words":[{"text":"있는","x":142,"y":237,"width":55,"height":29},{"text":"것은","x":209,"y":236,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"사전안의","x":274,"y":235,"width":106,"height":31},{"text":"단어들이","x":393,"y":236,"width":102,"height":30},{"text":"알파t,겟순으로","x":508,"y":237,"width":151,"height":30},{"text":"정릴되이","x":671,"y":235,"width":94,"height":32},{"text":"있기","x":779,"y":234,"width":44,"height":31},{"text":"때문이다.","x":837,"y":233,"width":104,"height":31},{"text":"만약","x":956,"y":232,"width":52,"height":31},{"text":"사전이","x":1018,"y":231,"width":75,"height":32},{"text":"알파,央주으로","x":1106,"y":230,"width":160,"height":31}]},{"text":"정릴되어 있지 않다면 특정 단어를 찾는 것은 기의 불가능할 것이다. 이는 김퓨터도 마찬가지다.","words":[{"text":"정릴되어","x":142,"y":288,"width":107,"height":31},{"text":"있지","x":265,"y":288,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"않다면","x":328,"y":288,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"특정","x":418,"y":288,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"단어를","x":481,"y":288,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"찾는","x":567,"y":288,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"것은","x":628,"y":2